## Phase 3 — Training job, immutable dataset, artifact, progress

### Task 3.1: Training schemas/state transitions

**Output:** `TrainingJobCreate`, status/progress, immutable binding, transition function, parent retry.

- [ ] Impact ResearchRun/migrations.
- [ ] Failing tests mọi valid path/terminal rejection.
- [ ] Implement pure transition/Pydantic schemas.
- [ ] Reject client-authored results/environment/code revision/terminal status.
- [ ] Migration fields/tests cho progress/parent/action.
- [ ] Schema/state/migration tests.

### Task 3.2: Resolve immutable dataset versions

- [ ] Impact dataset symbols.
- [ ] Tests missing/mutable/mismatch/class/split/path traversal.
- [ ] Implement resolver bằng persistence/path utility hiện có.
- [ ] Giới hạn count/dimension/media.
- [ ] Dataset/security regressions.

### Task 3.3: Training-job API/orchestrator boundary

- [ ] Impact router/research/node registry.
- [ ] Auth API tests create/read/cancel/unknown/invalid/duplicate.
- [ ] Implement server metadata/transaction-safe state.
- [ ] Algorithm nằm sau typed callable; không có SVM logic.
- [ ] Giữ legacy read; v1 không cho client tạo result mới.
- [ ] API/service tests.

### Task 3.4: Progress/cancel/verified artifacts

- [ ] Impact ArtifactStore/background execution.
- [ ] Tests monotonic progress, cancel race, checksum/length/size/failure/terminal.
- [ ] Safe checkpoint và atomic artifact record.
- [ ] Verify reads, ẩn storage URI.
- [ ] Recovery đánh dấu orphaned running job failed nếu không có valid lease.
- [ ] Service/integration tests.

### Task 3.5: Frontend training client/job panel

- [ ] Impact NodeInspector/service.
- [ ] Tests payload/polling cleanup/cancel/error/duplicate.
- [ ] Implement service/hook bằng existing API client/auth.
- [ ] Accessible generic panel, không algorithm fields.
- [ ] Tests/fake timers/typecheck/build.

### Checkpoint Phase 3

- [ ] Fake trainable node create/progress/cancel/fail/complete verified run, không platform SVM code.
- [ ] Dataset/artifact security đạt.
- [ ] Backend/core integration + frontend full suites.
- [ ] Update state/change detection.
- [ ] Hỏi **“Phase 3 đã đạt checkpoint. Có tiếp tục Phase 4 không?”** rồi dừng.

