## Phase 6 — Model registration và production lifecycle acceptance

### Task 6.1: UI tạo model/version

- [ ] Impact endpoints/pages/payload.
- [ ] Tests auth/lineage/integrity/validation/duplicate/UI states.
- [ ] Implement completed run -> model -> artifact -> immutable version.
- [ ] Reject artifact sai run hoặc run/validation không đạt.
- [ ] Focused tests.

### Task 6.2: Promotion/rollback/event acceptance

- [ ] Failing concurrency/full journey tests.
- [ ] Implement locking/revalidation/audit còn thiếu.
- [ ] Assert reason/actor/current/target/time/no rollback alias.
- [ ] API/UI suites.

### Task 6.3: Immutable production binding/inference

- [ ] Impact resolver/inspection/workflow execution; cảnh báo HIGH/CRITICAL.
- [ ] E2E valid champion/missing/alias changed/checksum/missing artifact/SVM inference.
- [ ] Implement phần immutable resolution/verification còn thiếu.
- [ ] Past run lineage không đổi sau promotion/rollback.
- [ ] Production/release regression tests.

### Task 6.4: Final E2E acceptance

- [ ] Chạy dataset -> SVM workflow -> Research -> version -> champion -> immutable binding -> inference -> viewer, ghi IDs/checksums/counts.
- [ ] Chạy failure/cancel/rollback journeys.
- [ ] Chạy full frontend/backend/core/node/integration/contract/docs/benchmark/typecheck/build.
- [ ] Ghi unrelated failures riêng; acceptance-critical failure thì phase chưa complete.
- [ ] Change detection và so toàn scope với spec.

### Checkpoint Phase 6

- [ ] Complete vertical slice/lifecycle acceptance có evidence.
- [ ] Không production claim vượt target/runtime/data đã test.
- [ ] Update state/change detection.
- [ ] Hỏi **“Phase 6 đã đạt checkpoint. Có tiếp tục Phase 7 không?”** rồi dừng.

